A sorrowful... and unshakable lonesomeness...

00:20:29.294 --> 00:20:29.886
Yes...

00:20:30.362 --> 00:20:35.664
A sense of loneliness rises
from the shadows in my heart...

00:20:43.609 --> 00:20:49.605
Ever since that day, I never had that
dream again, and I stopped feeling lonely.

00:21:02.661 --> 00:21:05.358
But... then why?

00:21:11.103 --> 00:21:17.372
Why do men desire women,
and women desire men?

00:21:21.813 --> 00:21:24.475
There's no reason,
Riyuu nanka nakute

00:21:24.716 --> 00:21:30.519
we're just happy when we're together
issho nara ureshiku nattari

00:21:31.056 --> 00:21:39.056
Somehow we connect, everyone together
Nanto naku tsuuji au minna ga ii ne

00:21:47.406 --> 00:21:52.469
We lay down on the riverbed
Kawara no shamen nekoron da

00:21:52.678 --> 00:21:55.511
stretching our arms and legs
teashi wo nobashite

00:21:56.748 --> 00:22:04.485
Birds flew above our heads
Atama no ue wo tori tachi ga tobitatta

00:22:06.024 --> 00:22:10.461
I just look up at the sky
Futo miageta kyou no sora

00:22:10.729 --> 00:22:13.562
it seems to spread forever
doko mademo hirogaru

00:22:14.199 --> 00:22:19.414
All the things bothering me
Donna yuutsu na koto demo

00:22:19.438 --> 00:22:24.274
<i>seem so small
chiisaku omoeru yo</i>

00:22:27.045 --> 00:22:29.776
There's no reason,
Riyuu nanka nakute

00:22:29.915 --> 00:22:35.820
we just sing our favorite songs
suki na uta kuchi zusande tari

00:22:36.288 --> 00:22:44.288
That's the best, that's when it feels great
Sonna toki ga ichiban kimochi ga ii ne

00:22:51.036 --> 00:22:53.903
Next episode

00:22:54.673 --> 00:22:58.200
Flurries, an idol, Santa Claus...

00:22:59.511 --> 00:23:03.778
Hey! Hey! Hey! Take you out to eat?
Go somewhere with you?

00:23:04.249 --> 00:23:06.684
Why should I do that for
someone I don't even know?

00:23:07.586 --> 00:23:10.351
What? Now you want me to stop the train?

00:23:11.189 --> 00:23:11.332
Before Winter Comes

00:23:11.356 --> 00:23:12.600
Before Winter Comes
Next episode of Boys Be...

00:23:12.624 --> 00:23:13.167
Before Winter Comes

00:23:13.191 --> 00:23:14.235
Before Winter Comes
Before Winter Comes.

00:23:14.259 --> 00:23:15.370
Before Winter Comes

00:23:15.394 --> 00:23:15.870
Before Winter Comes
Mori-Jyun? Who's that?

00:23:15.894 --> 00:23:17.794
Mori-Jyun? Who's that?
